    <title>Oregon (enterprise zone tax): data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/oregon-enterprise-zone-tax-or</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-oregon-(enterprise-zone-tax)-or</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>HB 4084 — makes new data centers ineligible for Enterprise Zone property tax breaks until 90 days after the 2027 session adjourns. Separate from the proposed 3-year construction moratorium. Oregon DC tax breaks cost ~\$450M/year</description>
  </item>
